            "Shallower depth wins — that is how you override",
            "Reach the shadowed one explicitly: `s.Logger.Printf(...)`",
            "Field name is the unqualified type name: `Logger`, `Mutex`"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Decorator In Six Lines"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "go",
          "lines": [
            "type cw struct {",
            "\tio.Writer",
            "\tn int",
            "}"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "`sync.Mutex` Caution",
          "items": [
            "Embedding it exports `Lock`/`Unlock` on your public API",
            "Use a named field `mu sync.Mutex` if that is unintended"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "Composition, not inheritance",
          "text": "Embed for reuse, define small interfaces for polymorphism. There is no `super` and no polymorphic self."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Two Assertion Forms",
          "ink": "accent"
